## Required test matrix

**Declared denominator: 42 cases, exactly 1..42.** One substantive executable Rust test per `// WORK_UNIT_CASE: 610/<case>` immediately above attributes, with exact source/discovery/executed-pass binding.

1. valid two-rival probe;
2. multi-rival result matrix;
3. exact objective/result/affordance/disposition vocabulary;
4. bundle/draft/rival/task/scope/fence mismatch;
5. duplicate/same-ID-changed objective/candidate/affordance/result;
6. vague more-information objective;
7. exact evidence/verifier-gap objective;
8. resolved/nonmaterial/out-of-scope objective;
9. bounded closed result schema;
10. open/unbounded result space rejected;
11. identical updates for all outcomes rejected;
12. confirmation-only/no falsifier rejected;
13. tautology/self-report rejected;
14. unrelated proxy rejected;
15. chronology/correlation not causal proof;
