21. safe read-only candidate;
22. effectful candidate requires external approval/blocked state;
23. privacy/consent/secret/authority/effect/reversibility violations;
24. possible-effect uncertainty/reconciliation requirement;
25. every independent budget boundary/one-over;
26. unknown cost/capacity not zero;
27. no budget cross-subsidy;
28. exact-equivalent merge retains lineage;
29. dominance proven across all relevant dimensions, not unknown/incomparable;
30. cheaper-riskier alternative retained;
31. no scalar/averaged risk;
32. explicit lexicographic order/stable tie-break;
33. exact objective/candidate dispositions/frontier;
34. observed-result/evidence/resolution injection rejected;
35. replay and changed input/policy conflict;
36. irrelevant order preserves plan/digest;
37. bounded panic-free malformed/property inputs;
38. ready probe has two valid differently updating outcomes;
39. ready probe has no failed/unknown mandatory safety dimension;
40. every material unknown has one objective disposition;
41. changed rival/affordance/policy invalidates identity;
42. no provider/tool/agent/process/network/Store/execution/reservation/promotion/Finish path.

